 Pfizer (PFE) Cheap As Its Enodia Deal Fuels Oncology Growth Hopes?","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxOX0hqd3hjQTN5MmJRSkdkdk5UNlZiOWZQQzZVb1AtbEJfNm8zcWFlUHZZemxyRVU5MVBqcnU1cFVyNXlnVFAwX2hLMlN5N3pDU2UtWHBWeURMbVYtU2I0ZUMwVTMyaEZ2LVZiWVNYTzVXeVB4eENFREwtVERnVmk5NzFab0hhaDRxZzVwNHlDTzRYYlU?oc=5","date":"2026-10-24","zh":"輝瑞 (PFE) 是否便宜，因為其 Enodia 交易激發了腫瘤學增長的希望？"},{"title":"Pharma sector doubles down on AI to slash costs, timelines","src":"Reuters","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"製藥業加倍投入人工智慧以削減成本和時間"}],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-26","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/78003/000007800326000026/pfe-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Pfizer Inc. is a research-based, global biopharmaceutical company. We apply science and our global resources to bring therapies to people that extend and significantly improve their lives through the discovery, development, manufacture, marketing, sale and distribution of","zh":"輝瑞公司是一家以研究為基礎的全球生物製藥公司。我們運用科學和全球資源，透過發現、開發、製造、行銷、銷售和分銷以下藥物，為人們提供治療方法，延長並顯著改善他們的生活："},{"en":"biopharmaceutical products worldwide. We work across developed and emerging markets to advance wellness, prevention, treatments and cures that challenge the most feared diseases of our time. We collaborate with healthcare providers, governments and local communities to support and expand access to reliable, affordable healthcare around the world. The Company was incorporated under the laws of the State of Delaware on June 2, 1942.","zh":"全球生物製藥產品。我們在已開發市場和新興市場開展工作，推動健康、預防、治療和治愈，應對當今時代最可怕的疾病。我們與醫療保健提供者、政府和當地社區合作，支持並擴大世界各地獲得可靠、負擔得起的醫療保健的機會。該公司於 1942 年 6 月 2 日根據特拉華州法律成立。"},{"en":"Most of our revenues come from the manufacture and sale of biopharmaceutical products. We believe that our medicines and vaccines provide significant value for healthcare providers and patients through improved treatment of diseases and improvements in health, wellness and productivity as well as by reducing other healthcare costs, such as emergency room visits or hospitalizations. We seek to enhance the value of our medicines and vaccines and actively engage in dialogues about how we can best work with patients, physicians and payors to prevent and treat disease and improve outcomes. We seek to maximize patient access and evaluate our pricing arrangements and contracting methods with payors to minimize adverse impact on our revenues within the current legal and pricing structures.","zh":"我們的大部分收入來自生物製藥產品的製造和銷售。我們相信，我們的藥物和疫苗透過改善疾病治療和改善健康、保健和生產力以及減少其他醫療保健成本（例如急診室就診或住院治療），為醫療保健提供者和患者提供重大價值。我們尋求提高藥物和疫苗的價值，並積極參與對話，討論如何最好地與患者、醫生和付款人合作，預防和治療疾病並改善結果。我們尋求最大限度地提高患者的獲取機會，並評估我們的定價安排和與付款人的簽約方法，以盡量減少在當前法律和定價結構內對我們收入的不利影響。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":51663000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Royalty","val":1650000000,"zh":"版稅"},{"name":"Pfizer Centre One","val":1338000000,"zh":"輝瑞中心一號"},{"name":"Pfizer Ignite","val":41000000,"zh":"輝瑞點燃"}],"total":62579000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":37078000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"International Developed Markets","val":16188000000,"zh":"國際已開發市場"},{"name":"International Emerging Markets","val":9313000000,"zh":"國際新興市場"}],"total":62579000000}},"peers":["JNJ","MRK","XOM","VZ","JPM"]}}